00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:57.000
For sure. There's also a really interesting thing happened in September 11, which was after the first plane hit the towers, there was a huge anticipated affect. What is going to happen next? Is it going to be the end of it? And there's a lot of really interesting works showing that anticipated affect is actually stronger in intensity than the actual thing. And so people were not only kind of responding to what happened, but also extremely anxious

