You're listening to Hidden Brain. I'm Shankar Vedantam. Amit Goldenberg is a psychologist at Harvard Business School. He studies what happens when the things we feel are shared by tens or millions of other people. He's found that shared emotions can have surprising effects on all of us. I mean, in October 1938, millions of Americans were listening to the radio

