00:28:59.000 --> 00:29:40.000
that I believe is better in some ways, or I believe is more balanced. But when you give them a choice, or when you have them to interact with someone who's less extreme or more extreme and you ask them, how much did you like that person? They tend to prefer the people who are more extreme. And that tendency, that acrophily, has a huge impact over time on the rate and the degree of segregation and polarization that may occur within a network. As we are drawn to notice individuals who show heightened emotion, we unconsciously

